WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 10]

01:46.060 --> 01:46.660
Liu Shao.

01:55.780 --> 01:56.580
Lu Li.

01:57.620 --> 01:58.780
Lu Li, where are you?

01:59.340 --> 02:00.180
Lu Li?

02:05.860 --> 02:07.020
Isn't this my home?

02:08.210 --> 02:09.300
Why am I back?

02:24.420 --> 02:25.579
It's you?

02:26.420 --> 02:28.480
You changed my fate after I turned 18?

02:29.140 --> 02:29.940
That's right.

02:30.420 --> 02:31.020
It was me.

03:00.500 --> 03:01.630
I met the great demon

03:01.780 --> 03:04.020
and then hid in Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

03:04.020 --> 03:05.570
What an exciting life!

03:06.410 --> 03:07.250
But

03:07.900 --> 03:09.180
I still have to thank you

03:09.180 --> 03:10.580
for letting me meet Lu Li.

03:12.980 --> 03:13.660
Really?

03:26.370 --> 03:27.700
You're not him anymore.

03:28.300 --> 03:29.940
I am him.

03:30.540 --> 03:31.870
If you don't believe me,

03:32.140 --> 03:33.540
you can see for yourself.

03:34.420 --> 03:36.420
One has compassion for the universe

03:36.500 --> 03:38.530
while the other is a scourge to the three realms.

03:38.530 --> 03:39.810
You are not him.

03:41.020 --> 03:42.500
They are…

03:43.660 --> 03:44.780
Lu Li.

03:45.579 --> 03:46.780
Do you see?

03:48.579 --> 03:49.380
It's me.

03:59.220 --> 04:01.260
She's destined to kill you.

04:04.420 --> 04:05.180
Liu Shao.

04:13.220 --> 04:14.480
How could this happen?

04:15.020 --> 04:15.580
Wait.

04:15.980 --> 04:17.110
This is an illusion.

04:17.620 --> 04:18.459
Lu Li?

04:19.420 --> 04:20.820
This must be an illusion.

04:42.980 --> 04:43.909
What's going on?

04:51.780 --> 04:53.040
How could this happen?

04:53.100 --> 04:53.900
That's right.

04:54.260 --> 04:55.580
Are they in danger?

05:08.660 --> 05:09.190
Liu Shao.

05:10.180 --> 05:11.100
I trust you.

05:19.610 --> 05:20.180
You…

05:21.260 --> 05:22.190
Can you get away?

05:35.740 --> 05:37.070
This is all an illusion.

05:37.340 --> 05:38.270
I have to get out.

06:03.780 --> 06:04.340
Brother.

06:09.100 --> 06:10.160
Brother, how is it?

06:19.780 --> 06:20.340
Brother.

06:20.340 --> 06:20.870
How is it?

06:20.900 --> 06:21.770
How is it?

06:28.300 --> 06:29.430
How are you feeling?

06:30.340 --> 06:31.340
Are you all right?

06:32.020 --> 06:32.820
Who was the one

06:33.260 --> 06:34.990
who broke through the illusion

06:35.180 --> 06:36.580
and completed the trial?

06:50.220 --> 06:51.180
Was it me?

06:53.340 --> 06:54.980
But I didn't do anything.

06:55.860 --> 06:56.990
Lu Li, wasn't it you?

06:57.740 --> 06:58.470
It wasn't me.

06:59.100 --> 06:59.700
It was you.

07:00.870 --> 07:02.580
From the Spirit Fire to King Herb,

07:02.580 --> 07:04.040
and then to the Moon Sword,

07:04.540 --> 07:05.620
it's been proven

07:05.910 --> 07:08.310
that you're the right one to draw the sword.

07:11.620 --> 07:12.380
In that case,

07:13.860 --> 07:15.460
Liu Shao will draw the sword.

07:18.540 --> 07:21.100
You will inherit the title of Marquis Wuyang.

07:22.420 --> 07:23.860
-Lu Li. -That's impossible.

07:23.860 --> 07:25.260
Lu Li is the current Marquis Wuyang?

07:25.260 --> 07:26.260
My Lord, well...

07:26.260 --> 07:27.820
He who knows others is smart.

07:27.820 --> 07:29.420
He who knows himself is wise.

07:29.500 --> 07:31.560
He who overcomes others is powerful.

07:31.900 --> 07:34.159
He who disciples himself is invincible.

07:34.540 --> 07:35.380
I trust you.

07:40.460 --> 07:41.520
Thank you, my Lord.

07:54.500 --> 07:57.810
I'll give you half of the King Herb.

07:59.380 --> 08:00.180
But my Lord,

08:01.170 --> 08:03.300
don't you need this to renew your life?

08:03.300 --> 08:05.020
It's far better to renew the future of the world

08:05.020 --> 08:07.620
than renew my life alone.

08:19.020 --> 08:20.280
I'll accept the order.

08:23.650 --> 08:24.490
I wish

08:26.170 --> 08:27.300
the King Herb

08:28.100 --> 08:29.380
can help Liu Shao

08:29.380 --> 08:31.040
increase her spiritual power

08:32.780 --> 08:34.240
to pull out the Moon Sword.

08:41.900 --> 08:43.500
From then on, the human world

08:45.500 --> 08:47.940
will only kneel to our parents,

08:48.580 --> 08:49.340
no longer

08:50.180 --> 08:51.380
held by other races.

08:52.500 --> 08:54.340
I'll accept the order.

08:55.740 --> 08:58.200
To pacify the demons and protect all beings!

09:03.820 --> 09:04.280
My Lord.

09:04.860 --> 09:05.940
The two disciples of Marquis Wuyang

09:05.940 --> 09:07.460
have come out from the Moon Platform.

09:07.460 --> 09:08.860
I heard the female disciple

09:08.860 --> 09:10.460
passed the Moon Sword Trial.

09:15.330 --> 09:16.170
That means

09:17.940 --> 09:20.740
she might really be able to pull out the Moon Sword.

09:25.420 --> 09:26.740
She's good, brother.

09:29.300 --> 09:30.060
Tell me.

09:30.500 --> 09:31.760
What's her name again?

09:32.700 --> 09:33.230
Liu Shao?

09:35.460 --> 09:37.120
It seems that the three worlds

09:37.980 --> 09:39.640
will never be peaceful again.

09:42.010 --> 09:43.470
There has never been peace

09:43.890 --> 09:45.340
in the three worlds.

09:46.060 --> 09:47.220
Its chaos

09:47.580 --> 09:48.820
is not bad for us.

09:49.180 --> 09:49.820
Right?

10:04.910 --> 10:08.480
[Qiutian Pavilion]

10:11.740 --> 10:13.380
I can't believe the immortal

10:13.860 --> 10:15.210
looked like you.

10:15.210 --> 10:18.210
That was an illusion created by the Moon Sword, right?

10:19.900 --> 10:20.900
What you saw

10:21.020 --> 10:21.700
was me.

10:25.060 --> 10:27.180
Because I knew you were trapped in there too.

10:27.180 --> 10:28.710
So I used our opposing power

10:29.060 --> 10:30.380
to push you to your potential

10:30.380 --> 10:32.180
and break through the illusion.

10:32.580 --> 10:35.180
Weren't you afraid you'd strangle me to death?

10:38.620 --> 10:39.370
I was.

10:40.480 --> 10:41.340
Of course I was.

10:42.070 --> 10:43.270
But I was more worried

10:43.330 --> 10:45.190
we couldn't get through the spell

10:45.500 --> 10:46.460
and die inside.

10:50.690 --> 10:51.950
If you are still upset,

10:52.140 --> 10:52.600
come on.

10:53.500 --> 10:54.030
Pinch me.

10:54.580 --> 10:55.180
Pinch you?

10:56.380 --> 10:58.060
I don't want to.

10:58.060 --> 10:59.660
I'm afraid to stain my hands.

11:00.170 --> 11:01.740
If you dare to cheat me,

11:02.100 --> 11:03.630
I'll pull out the Moon Sword

11:04.500 --> 11:05.230
and stab you.

11:12.770 --> 11:13.340
Lu Li.

11:14.140 --> 11:14.900
Do you see?

11:15.660 --> 11:17.610
She's destined to kill you.

11:20.330 --> 11:22.460
Wait, I clearly saw

11:23.020 --> 11:25.420
the Moon Sword devouring the God of the Sun.

11:26.060 --> 11:27.120
Is there no problem

11:28.260 --> 11:29.920
for Liu Shao to draw the sword?

11:35.450 --> 11:36.140
Lu Li.

11:37.580 --> 11:38.840
What are you thinking?

11:39.860 --> 11:40.740
Nothing.

11:42.100 --> 11:44.100
When are you going to draw the sword?

11:44.780 --> 11:45.530
My Lord

11:45.620 --> 11:47.980
let me refine the power of the King Herb tonight.

11:47.980 --> 11:49.330
I'll go draw it tomorrow at noon

11:49.330 --> 11:51.660
when the Qi of the Greatness is at its peak.

11:52.580 --> 11:53.380
For your sake,

11:53.660 --> 11:54.620
and my own sake,

11:55.060 --> 11:56.720
I will pull out the Moon Sword.

11:59.660 --> 12:00.140
Okay.

12:01.380 --> 12:02.820
I have to go out of the mansion.

12:02.820 --> 12:04.150
Wait for me to come back.

12:06.900 --> 12:07.580
Remember.

12:08.420 --> 12:10.020
Make sure you wait for me to come back before you draw the sword.

12:10.020 --> 12:11.080
Do you understand?

12:12.300 --> 12:13.300
It's such an important thing.

12:13.300 --> 12:14.900
Of course I will wait for you.

12:30.060 --> 12:31.390
What's wrong with Lu Li?

12:31.770 --> 12:33.740
Why did the Moon Sword

12:33.980 --> 12:36.240
let me see an immortal looking like Lu Li?

12:52.940 --> 12:53.400
Master.

12:58.380 --> 13:00.790
Liu Shao has passed the ultimate trial of Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

13:00.790 --> 13:02.680
I believe she can pull out the Moon Sword.

13:02.680 --> 13:03.620
Very well.

13:05.170 --> 13:06.970
I came back to ask you for advice.

13:07.740 --> 13:08.780
Will it be dangerous

13:08.780 --> 13:10.440
for Liu Shao to draw the sword?

13:11.690 --> 13:14.060
Moon Sword is left behind by the gods.

13:14.500 --> 13:15.960
How could it be dangerous?

13:16.980 --> 13:17.840
Then do you know

13:18.600 --> 13:21.060
what the ultimate trial of the Moon Sword is?

13:22.380 --> 13:23.910
It's just a trial of a sword.

13:24.940 --> 13:26.670
Without the master's control,

13:27.380 --> 13:28.140
it's nothing more than

13:28.140 --> 13:28.940
a false

13:29.300 --> 13:31.700
and confusing illusion.

13:33.180 --> 13:34.540
But the illusion

13:34.860 --> 13:35.990
is just like a dream.

13:37.020 --> 13:39.080
It comes either from one's own memory

13:39.300 --> 13:41.030
or from the memory of the sword.

13:42.820 --> 13:43.820
In my vision,

13:44.540 --> 13:46.620
Liu Shao killed me with the Moon Sword.

13:46.620 --> 13:48.220
But she suffered a backlash.

13:52.180 --> 13:54.380
It's a sword from ten thousand years ago.

13:54.380 --> 13:56.440
How could it have memories of you two?

14:01.820 --> 14:02.900
So

14:03.540 --> 14:04.470
in the illusion,

14:05.580 --> 14:07.420
we thought they were us,

14:07.860 --> 14:09.100
but it was an illusion created by the Moon Sword

14:09.100 --> 14:10.980
with the memories of the two gods,

14:11.260 --> 14:12.860
which was not entirely real?

14:13.540 --> 14:15.870
But there is one thing that can't be wrong.

14:16.780 --> 14:17.860
If even the God of the Sun

14:17.860 --> 14:19.860
was once devoured by the Moon Sword,

14:20.060 --> 14:21.190
what about Liu Shao?

14:21.340 --> 14:22.800
Will Liu Shao be in danger?

14:23.740 --> 14:24.980
As long as she doesn't use her vitality,

14:24.980 --> 14:26.910
she'll be safe from the devouring.

14:28.260 --> 14:30.100
Liu Shao wants to pull out the Moon Sword.

14:30.100 --> 14:31.900
How can she not use her vitality?

14:31.900 --> 14:33.500
Master, do you have any more…

14:40.540 --> 14:41.180
Master.

14:41.980 --> 14:42.700
Master.

14:45.540 --> 14:46.140
Master.

14:47.330 --> 14:48.900
Master! Master!

14:49.900 --> 14:50.900
Master.

14:54.380 --> 14:54.900
Ma…

15:01.820 --> 15:04.540
Master, I only found this in his room.

15:18.980 --> 15:19.620
Go on.

15:20.700 --> 15:21.220
Yes.

15:29.900 --> 15:32.740
If only one of you can live,

15:34.330 --> 15:36.500
I will choose my disciple.

15:58.980 --> 15:59.900
Remember.

16:00.420 --> 16:01.940
Make sure you wait for me to come back before you draw the sword.

16:01.940 --> 16:03.000
Do you understand?

16:03.060 --> 16:04.780
Lu Li is not back yet.

16:07.180 --> 16:08.780
I want to draw the Moon Sword.

16:09.140 --> 16:09.700
Okay.

16:10.140 --> 16:10.940
I'll help you.

16:12.900 --> 16:13.580
Liu Shao.

16:15.060 --> 16:18.660
In fact, there is another reason why I want to draw the Moon Sword.

16:18.980 --> 16:20.540
I want to find out my origin.

16:22.580 --> 16:24.380
You want the Moon Sword so badly.

16:24.860 --> 16:26.590
Why haven't you returned then?

16:27.100 --> 16:29.020
Do you think he's really being nice to you?

16:29.020 --> 16:30.010
He just wants you

16:30.010 --> 16:31.940
to help him pull out the Moon Sword.

16:32.340 --> 16:34.210
Our master is both Lu Sheng.

16:34.620 --> 16:35.580
Liu Shao.

16:35.820 --> 16:37.220
So he didn't tell you?

16:38.260 --> 16:39.660
It seems he's been hiding a lot of things

16:39.660 --> 16:40.700
from you.

16:44.620 --> 16:48.340
Is he hiding something from me?

17:08.420 --> 17:09.380
Brother didn't come back

17:09.380 --> 17:11.060
I didn't see him all night last night.

17:11.060 --> 17:11.980
How come?

17:12.220 --> 17:13.819
It's such a big deal for Liu Shao to draw the sword.

17:13.819 --> 17:15.680
How can he disappear at this time?

17:16.460 --> 17:17.579
I have a vague feeling

17:17.579 --> 17:19.339
that something is wrong with Lu Li.

17:19.339 --> 17:20.800
I'll go look for him again.

17:20.980 --> 17:21.740
I'll go with you.

17:21.740 --> 17:22.180
Let's go.

17:22.180 --> 17:22.910
I'm leaving.

17:32.620 --> 17:35.020
There are many things Lu Li didn't tell you.

17:54.140 --> 17:55.340
Don't worry.

17:56.660 --> 17:58.590
We just need to endure one more day.

17:59.260 --> 18:01.190
Everything I've done is for today.

18:02.340 --> 18:04.000
After she gets the Moon Sword,

18:05.100 --> 18:07.300
I'll never care about that woman again.

18:08.780 --> 18:09.380
I know.

18:10.140 --> 18:11.940
You and I are childhood friends.

18:12.260 --> 18:14.120
Liu Shao can't compare with that.

18:14.660 --> 18:15.380
It's just

18:15.980 --> 18:17.440
that you've worked so hard

18:17.900 --> 18:19.050
to win her dependence.

18:19.050 --> 18:21.050
After she pulled out the Moon Sword,

18:21.900 --> 18:23.660
I'll show up and take it away.

18:24.700 --> 18:26.340
And then charge her with collusion with the demon world

18:26.340 --> 18:29.100
and intend to rebel. How about that?

18:30.700 --> 18:31.500
Lu Li.

18:34.780 --> 18:35.340
Lu Li.

18:36.660 --> 18:37.300
Lu Li.

18:38.940 --> 18:39.780
Where is Lu Li?

18:40.050 --> 18:41.420
Are you playing some kind of trick again

18:41.420 --> 18:42.660
and having someone pretend to be him?

18:42.660 --> 18:43.500
What Lu Li?

18:44.140 --> 18:45.140
Where is he?

18:45.980 --> 18:47.140
You know him so well.

18:47.700 --> 18:49.620
How could I find someone to pretend to be him?

18:49.620 --> 18:50.380
Then where…

18:54.300 --> 18:55.700
This is Lu Li's money bag.

18:57.060 --> 18:57.620
Lu Li!

18:58.130 --> 18:59.140
Lu Li, come out!

18:59.140 --> 19:00.100
Explain to me!

19:00.620 --> 19:01.740
Lu Li, come out!

19:21.570 --> 19:24.680
[Imperial Cosmo Hall]

19:57.260 --> 19:57.780
I will

19:58.850 --> 20:00.180
be outside the mansion

20:01.020 --> 20:01.980
to guard you.

20:05.940 --> 20:07.000
Thank you, my Lord.

20:23.820 --> 20:24.420
Remember.

20:25.060 --> 20:26.780
Make sure you wait for me to come back before you draw the sword.

20:26.780 --> 20:27.840
Do you understand?

20:29.460 --> 20:31.460
After she pulled out the Moon Sword,

20:32.020 --> 20:33.860
I'll show up and take it away.

20:34.740 --> 20:35.260
Lu Li.

20:36.260 --> 20:39.060
Which one is real and which one is not?

20:55.420 --> 20:56.410
I can't think about this.

20:56.410 --> 20:57.700
I have to calm down.

20:57.700 --> 20:59.430
First, pull out the Moon Sword.

21:02.660 --> 21:03.660
Liu Shao.

21:03.660 --> 21:04.660
Wait for me.

21:19.500 --> 21:20.460
Liu Shao!

21:21.860 --> 21:23.540
Don't draw your sword!

21:38.210 --> 21:39.140
It's a seal.

21:40.180 --> 21:42.040
The seal left by the God of the Sun.

21:42.860 --> 21:44.060
But how do I break it?

21:45.740 --> 21:46.540
Do I have to

21:47.420 --> 21:49.220
use the vitality in my body?

22:26.740 --> 22:27.340
Liu Shao!

22:41.660 --> 22:42.260
Liu Shao!

22:42.500 --> 22:43.140
No!

23:10.220 --> 23:10.940
Liu Shao!

23:11.180 --> 23:12.500
Put the sword down!

23:18.900 --> 23:20.360
I've sealed the Moon Sword

23:20.540 --> 23:22.000
here with my spirit today.

23:22.700 --> 23:24.030
For thousands of years,

23:24.530 --> 23:26.190
those who do not have my spirit

23:26.260 --> 23:27.660
shall not touch it.

23:30.060 --> 23:30.740
So

23:31.340 --> 23:33.540
I'm the key to unlock the Seal of the Sun.

23:34.140 --> 23:35.580
Put it down!

24:17.710 --> 24:20.480
[Immortal Palace. Four Seasons Tablet]

24:40.460 --> 24:43.730
The Sun Spirit has reappeared on earth.

24:45.460 --> 24:46.500
I wonder

24:48.060 --> 24:50.450
if it's a blessing or a curse.

24:54.900 --> 24:56.160
What's going on today?

24:56.300 --> 24:58.100
The sunlight is shining directly into the sea.

24:58.100 --> 24:59.300
It has never been seen in a thousand years,

24:59.300 --> 25:01.820
no, in a million years.

25:04.740 --> 25:06.300
How can this happen?

25:14.860 --> 25:15.420
This is

25:16.930 --> 25:17.730
Glazed Fruit.

25:19.220 --> 25:21.820
The Brahma tree can actually break through the limiting demon world

25:21.820 --> 25:26.020
and bear the Glazed Fruit that has the spiritual energy of heaven and earth.

25:30.420 --> 25:31.580
Your little fairy

25:31.660 --> 25:33.580
really pulled out the Moon Sword?

25:49.780 --> 25:50.310
Liu Shao.

25:51.420 --> 25:52.060
Liu Shao.

25:58.930 --> 26:00.060
It's devouring her.

26:00.860 --> 26:02.790
I can't let Liu Shao hold the sword.

26:13.100 --> 26:14.660
He just wants you

26:14.660 --> 26:16.590
to help him pull out the Moon Sword.

26:23.660 --> 26:24.420
Liu Shao.

26:25.260 --> 26:25.940
Liu Shao.

26:27.730 --> 26:28.990
Don't come any closer.

26:32.980 --> 26:34.710
Are you here for the Moon Sword?

26:35.340 --> 26:36.600
Give me the Moon Sword.

26:36.860 --> 26:38.860
You can't withstand its devouring.

26:39.460 --> 26:40.780
I can't?

26:41.660 --> 26:43.100
But you can?

26:48.340 --> 26:48.940
I'm sorry.

26:54.670 --> 26:55.100
Actually...

26:55.100 --> 26:55.780
Lu.

26:58.740 --> 26:59.700
Congratulations.

26:59.700 --> 27:01.160
You've got the Moon Sword.

27:01.290 --> 27:02.220
Why are you here?

27:05.940 --> 27:06.800
Did you forget?

27:07.100 --> 27:08.230
You promised Master

27:08.380 --> 27:10.780
that we'd return when we got the Moon Sword.

27:11.260 --> 27:13.520
Now that you've completed your mission,

27:13.660 --> 27:15.020
we can go back.

27:15.210 --> 27:15.980
Bai Feng.

27:16.740 --> 27:18.140
Please behave yourself.

27:20.660 --> 27:22.660
What happens between me and Liu Shao

27:23.100 --> 27:24.560
has nothing to do with you.

27:27.660 --> 27:29.320
You've already got the sword.

27:29.460 --> 27:31.120
Why are you still pretending?

27:31.620 --> 27:32.740
Think about

27:33.180 --> 27:34.460
how much I've suffered

27:34.540 --> 27:35.980
due to this woman.

27:36.660 --> 27:37.740
What are you talking about?

27:37.740 --> 27:40.470
So you're just doing it for the Moon Sword, right?

27:43.460 --> 27:44.990
Lu Li, you've been using me.

27:45.580 --> 27:46.710
Don't listen to her…

27:49.740 --> 27:51.070
How can you do this to me?

27:51.620 --> 27:53.780
You made a vow under the Brahma tree before.

27:53.780 --> 27:56.310
The millions of Water Hyacinths can prove it.

27:57.300 --> 27:58.100
Liu Shao.

27:58.490 --> 27:59.420
He just wants

28:00.380 --> 28:01.700
the Moon Sword.

28:02.660 --> 28:04.780
You are the only one who can unseal it.

28:05.100 --> 28:06.900
That's why he treats you so well.

28:09.940 --> 28:10.740
So…

28:10.970 --> 28:11.700
I didn't.

28:12.340 --> 28:14.660
The illusion in the Moon Sword was real.

28:15.930 --> 28:17.660
You've been using me all along.

28:17.900 --> 28:19.580
You've always hurt me.

28:24.220 --> 28:25.680
I never wanted to hurt you.

28:29.180 --> 28:31.620
Please don't make things difficult for him.

28:31.620 --> 28:33.620
He doesn't need to hurt you himself.

28:34.410 --> 28:35.260
Do you know

28:35.540 --> 28:37.740
that you and the Moon Sword are spiritually incompatible?

28:37.740 --> 28:39.340
Pulling out the Moon Sword

28:40.260 --> 28:41.390
will cost your life.

28:41.700 --> 28:42.630
Don't stir it up.

28:46.350 --> 28:47.410
Liu Shao won't die.

28:53.740 --> 28:54.800
I won't let her die.

29:08.440 --> 29:09.980
Give me back the sword.

29:21.500 --> 29:22.180
Liu Shao.

29:24.820 --> 29:26.280
You can't touch the sword.

30:07.740 --> 30:08.330
Liu Shao.

30:09.420 --> 30:10.540
I didn't.

30:13.420 --> 30:15.350
I never wanted to steal your sword.

30:40.250 --> 30:41.140
Liu Shao.

31:00.760 --> 31:02.890
Everything I've done is for today.

31:03.660 --> 31:05.060
Once I get the Moon Sword,

31:05.260 --> 31:07.400
I'll never care about that woman again.

31:07.400 --> 31:09.400
I'll just show up and take the sword.

31:33.180 --> 31:34.060
No.

31:43.460 --> 31:44.100
Lu Li.

31:44.540 --> 31:45.170
Lu Li.

31:45.420 --> 31:46.740
Go away.

31:47.740 --> 31:48.980
She's done this to you.

31:48.980 --> 31:50.380
Why do you care about her?

31:58.860 --> 32:00.190
It's all because of you.

32:00.540 --> 32:03.140
It's because of you that Lu Li did this to me.

32:14.820 --> 32:15.500
Liu Shao.

32:16.460 --> 32:17.260
Don't!

32:44.850 --> 32:45.380
Liu Shao!

32:51.260 --> 32:52.780
That's interesting.

32:54.700 --> 32:56.260
Is she going to

32:56.260 --> 32:59.660
bring the sword to Aquatic Demons?

33:11.860 --> 33:12.540
Lu Li.

33:16.620 --> 33:17.150
Liu Shao.

33:20.020 --> 33:20.550
Liu Shao.

33:22.180 --> 33:22.780
Liu Shao.

33:25.540 --> 33:26.060
He Na.

33:27.100 --> 33:27.740
I'm sorry.

33:28.330 --> 33:30.190
You were the only one I thought of.

33:31.490 --> 33:32.220
Don't worry.

33:32.700 --> 33:33.900
It's going to be okay.

33:45.860 --> 33:46.460
Liu Shao.

33:47.380 --> 33:47.980
You have to

33:49.380 --> 33:50.420
trust me.

33:51.860 --> 33:52.420
He Na.

33:53.130 --> 33:53.900
Take me away.

33:54.860 --> 33:55.590
Take me away.

34:00.040 --> 34:01.220
Liu Shao.

34:00.440 --> 34:03.550
♫On rainy days, the wind blows smoke♫

34:03.550 --> 34:05.640
♫Into circles♫

34:06.340 --> 34:06.780
Okay.

34:06.550 --> 34:09.620
♫On both sides, I'm chanting♫

34:09.920 --> 34:11.719
♫The night is sleepless♫

34:13.030 --> 34:16.050
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

34:16.179 --> 34:18.360
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

34:18.800 --> 34:24.139
♫Your promise, my fate♫

34:24.840 --> 34:30.330
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

34:31.170 --> 34:37.060
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

34:37.310 --> 34:43.580
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can't hear it♫

34:37.340 --> 34:38.020
Lu Li.

34:39.060 --> 34:39.699
Lu Li.

34:41.420 --> 34:42.060
Lu Li.

34:43.820 --> 34:50.030
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

34:50.030 --> 34:55.520
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

34:56.409 --> 35:02.380
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

35:02.770 --> 35:08.780
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

35:09.070 --> 35:15.500
♫If you see me for the first time in this life, I'll forever hold it in my heart♫

35:27.650 --> 35:28.580
What's going on?

35:28.620 --> 35:29.950
Where is the Moon Sword?

35:30.020 --> 35:31.020
Where's Liu Shao?

35:31.260 --> 35:32.020
Where's the Moon Sword?

35:32.020 --> 35:33.420
Get the men together now.

35:33.460 --> 35:35.120
We must find Lu Li and Liu Shao.

35:35.210 --> 35:36.300
Apart from everything else,

35:36.300 --> 35:37.760
we can't let the Moon Sword

35:38.060 --> 35:40.140
fall into the hands of evil people.

35:41.070 --> 35:41.810
Yes.

35:43.880 --> 35:49.070
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

35:49.500 --> 35:51.500
Everything I've done is for today.

35:49.960 --> 35:56.360
♫Looking back at the love that still remains in your past life♫

35:53.090 --> 35:54.660
After she gets the Moon Sword,

35:54.660 --> 35:56.380
I'll never care about that woman again.

35:56.360 --> 36:02.650
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can't hear it♫

35:58.180 --> 35:59.460
Are you here for the Moon Sword?

35:59.460 --> 36:01.120
I'm here to get the Moon Sword.

36:01.220 --> 36:01.740
Don't.

36:02.180 --> 36:03.340
Don't take my Moon Sword.

36:02.650 --> 36:09.020
♫When the flowers fall, you and I will miss each other♫

36:04.380 --> 36:04.940
Don't.

36:05.940 --> 36:06.540
Liu Shao.

36:07.220 --> 36:08.150
Don't be afraid.

36:08.540 --> 36:09.260
I'm here.

36:09.230 --> 36:14.270
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

36:09.540 --> 36:11.070
No one will take it from you.

36:11.540 --> 36:12.210
Lu Li.

36:14.180 --> 36:15.020
Lu Li.

36:15.420 --> 36:21.660
♫After the missing, my face is still young♫

36:15.860 --> 36:17.320
Don't steal my Moon Sword.

36:19.260 --> 36:19.940
Liu Shao.

36:20.700 --> 36:21.740
It's me, He Na.

36:21.660 --> 36:27.850
♫The day the flowers fall in the garden, the day we meet♫

36:23.540 --> 36:24.740
Lu Li.

36:27.850 --> 36:33.640
♫ The year of my life fleets♫

36:32.140 --> 36:33.340
Lu Li.

36:34.080 --> 36:42.920
♫Whose year is it♫

36:39.930 --> 36:40.570
Lu Li.

36:53.100 --> 36:53.810
Lu Li.

36:54.300 --> 36:56.500
You're going to look for Liu Shao again?

37:00.590 --> 37:02.190
I won't allow you to go to her.

37:02.540 --> 37:04.400
You can't even protect yourself.

37:04.730 --> 37:06.460
Come back with me to see Master.

37:06.540 --> 37:07.940
Otherwise, if you lose the Moon Sword,

37:07.940 --> 37:10.600
you and Liu Shao won't be able to get away with it.

37:11.140 --> 37:13.200
I'll take you away to avoid the storm.

37:13.380 --> 37:15.260
Even if you find her, what can you do?

37:15.260 --> 37:17.620
Will she give you the sword? Will she?

37:19.340 --> 37:21.070
What happens between me and her

37:21.180 --> 37:22.580
is none of your business.

37:24.340 --> 37:25.740
It's none of my business?

37:26.500 --> 37:28.830
What do you mean, it's none of my business?

37:29.020 --> 37:30.340
You should know

37:30.620 --> 37:32.150
my feelings for you, right?

37:35.220 --> 37:36.380
Your feelings

37:37.020 --> 37:38.350
are none of my business.

37:39.340 --> 37:40.940
But if you hurt Liu Shao,

37:41.840 --> 37:43.230
then it's my business.

37:44.420 --> 37:45.550
I won't forgive you.

37:45.820 --> 37:47.220
Do you like her that much?

37:47.500 --> 37:48.030
Yes, I do.

37:49.100 --> 37:50.030
Unfortunately,

37:51.020 --> 37:52.820
you're not meant to be together.

37:53.450 --> 37:55.300
The Soul-Devouring Spell will kill you.

37:55.300 --> 37:57.380
And the Moon Sword will kill her.

37:58.340 --> 37:59.860
Just listen to me.

37:59.860 --> 38:01.580
I'm doing this for your good.

38:16.370 --> 38:17.610
The Moon Sword?

38:22.380 --> 38:24.440
The spiritual power of the Moon Sword

38:24.600 --> 38:26.400
is actually devouring Liu Shao.

38:57.780 --> 39:00.510
Their spiritual powers are mutually exclusive.

39:03.260 --> 39:05.300
This is not a simple weapon backlash.

39:05.300 --> 39:07.700
Liu Shao's spiritual power is so special.

39:10.980 --> 39:13.980
But why was she able to pull out the Moon Sword instead?

39:14.860 --> 39:16.720
The Moon Sword will kill Liu Shao.

39:17.220 --> 39:18.740
So you knew all along.

39:20.060 --> 39:21.580
This is unfair to Liu Shao.

39:22.820 --> 39:24.500
Liu Shao has suffered so much

39:25.300 --> 39:27.760
all because she helped me pull out the sword.

39:28.210 --> 39:29.470
I'm going to ask Master

39:30.210 --> 39:31.900
what he wants to do.

39:33.890 --> 39:35.140
So what if you go?

39:35.140 --> 39:36.740
Liu Shao won't forgive you.

39:43.980 --> 39:45.740
Because she saw

39:46.780 --> 39:49.110
me conspiring with you to kill her, right?

39:51.620 --> 39:52.780
Bai Feng.

39:55.980 --> 39:57.440
You planned so carefully,

39:58.020 --> 39:59.820
hoping Liu Shao to take me wrong.

40:01.020 --> 40:02.260
But what did she see?

40:02.820 --> 40:04.660
What she saw was the real you.

40:05.300 --> 40:06.650
But was what she saw

40:08.220 --> 40:09.300
the real me?

40:11.980 --> 40:13.460
You really disappoint me.

40:36.290 --> 40:37.290
Immortal Master.

40:37.540 --> 40:39.340
The Moon Sword had been pulled out by Liu Shao.

40:39.340 --> 40:40.020
But then

40:40.020 --> 40:41.740
she went missing

40:41.740 --> 40:43.300
with another disciple, Lu Li.

40:43.300 --> 40:45.430
There's no news of their whereabouts.

40:45.460 --> 40:47.340
I have sent many people to look for her

40:47.340 --> 40:47.900
and found

40:48.690 --> 40:49.420
it seemed

40:49.780 --> 40:51.580
to be related to the demon world.

40:52.260 --> 40:54.220
The Moon Sword has been unsealed.

40:54.220 --> 40:56.900
The feud it involves

40:57.060 --> 40:58.900
is beyond our control.

40:59.540 --> 41:01.060
Ignore it for now.

41:01.860 --> 41:02.660
Let's wait.

41:03.340 --> 41:03.900
Wait?

41:04.540 --> 41:05.420
Wait for what?

41:06.020 --> 41:10.740
Wait for a god who can control it.

41:13.820 --> 41:14.500
Yes.

41:16.410 --> 41:18.410
But I thought it's been 10,000 years

41:18.460 --> 41:20.460
since a God has been born in Immortal Palace.

41:20.460 --> 41:21.740
Immortal Luo Ge,

41:22.020 --> 41:23.380
disciple of the Immortal Master Wanwu,

41:23.380 --> 41:24.610
is said to be gifted

41:25.540 --> 41:27.540
who has the potential to become a God.

41:27.540 --> 41:29.340
Now, he's in seclusion

41:29.820 --> 41:31.580
striving for the status of Immortal.

41:31.580 --> 41:32.340
So it seems

41:32.700 --> 41:35.300
Luo Ge should soon be able to become an Immortal

41:35.540 --> 41:37.660
and dominate the Immortal Palace.

42:00.180 --> 42:01.910
Liu Shao is just a mortal woman.

42:02.620 --> 42:05.750
But she is devoured by the God of Moonlight's Moon Sword,

42:05.780 --> 42:08.110
and still unaffected by the Melody Flute.

42:09.100 --> 42:09.900
Liu Shao.

42:10.940 --> 42:14.140
How many secrets are hidden in your body?

42:34.820 --> 42:36.220
There is nothing I can do

42:36.450 --> 42:38.260
with the devouring of God's weapon.

42:38.260 --> 42:39.460
This is all

42:39.580 --> 42:40.650
I can do for you.

42:50.700 --> 42:51.900
Is Liu Shao

42:51.900 --> 42:53.300
really hopeless?

42:53.300 --> 42:56.010
At least there is no way to save her

42:56.010 --> 42:57.540
with the power of the demon world.

42:57.540 --> 42:58.380
In that case,

42:58.820 --> 43:00.100
I'm relieved.

43:01.540 --> 43:02.460
General Fu.

43:02.460 --> 43:03.940
What do you mean by that?

43:05.540 --> 43:07.820
My brother seems to have an interest in her.

43:07.820 --> 43:09.620
He always wastes his time on her.

43:10.020 --> 43:11.350
I'm tired of seeing her.

43:12.740 --> 43:14.200
Although I don't like her,

43:14.660 --> 43:16.420
I can use

43:16.740 --> 43:18.140
the Moon Sword she has.

43:20.100 --> 43:22.100
Since the Moon Sword is in our world,

43:22.380 --> 43:25.020
it'll help with my next plan.
